[{"title":"奉赠德新知府并呈明德通守时中判府良心长司善卿知事","author":"叶见泰","text":"朝发瑞溪县，夕憩苍梧城。\n苍梧有贤牧，寮采悉时英。\n宴我南薰楼，宿我嘉鱼亭。\n珍肴既重列，美酝仍细倾。\n莫夜继秉烛，优巫陈楚声。\n酒阑吐肝胆，驩焉若平生。\n黾勉服王事，行迈有期程。\n赠言无誇解，因之寄深情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22687,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邵武 其一","author":"叶仪凤","text":"溪上千峰碧玉环，瞰溪台榭紫云间。\n鸟啼花落非人世，似在金鳌山上山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22688,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邵武 其二","author":"叶仪凤","text":"城南城北草如茵，绿水青山眼界新。\n更问樵溪何处是，满城桃李万家春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22689,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"叶仪凤","text":"天钟秀气魁文陛，地涌仙源接武夷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22690,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"麻姑岩","author":"叶发","text":"怪石倚空碧，传有神仙迹。\n元放古来游，孝先旧曾历。\n山前无断碑，往事杳难觅。\n麻姑去不来，青鸟无消息。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22691,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"叶甲","text":"滁阳富山水，秀拔独琅琊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22692,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"苔钱","author":"叶岂潜","text":"青钱点点浮鹅眼，绿毯鳞鳞织翠毛。\n聚散因风翻覆手，池塘犹喜没惊涛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22693,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蝉","author":"叶岂潜","text":"柳边晓立看虫蜕，化作风餐露宿身。\n林静昼长吟不绝，骚骚清苦似诗人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22694,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鳜鱼","author":"叶岂潜","text":"渔翁今度笭箵富，正是桃花水腻时。\n网得文鳞如墨锦，贯来杨柳是金丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22695,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菊岩","author":"叶师文","text":"东风红紫过千千，独着黄衣不敢先。\n万仞峰头今一萼，别无花木可秋天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22696,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"叶延年","text":"一夜西风惊客枕，满堤杨柳作秋声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22697,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"叶延寿","text":"自昔吾泉出异僧，清溪今又两岩兴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22698,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"茉莉花","author":"叶廷圭","text":"露花洗出通身白，沈水熏成换骨香。\n近说根苗移上苑，休惭系本出南荒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22699,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"叶廷圭","text":"道旁曾种万株松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22700,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"叶廷圭","text":"人休清樾摩挲认，鸟泊高枝睥睨看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22701,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"叶廷圭","text":"戍兵数有流星递，元白诗筒幸寄将。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22702,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"叶廷圭","text":"名字惟因佛书见，根苗应逐贾胡来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22703,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"叶廷圭","text":"几多雁鹜行间吏，衙退频来礼释迦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22704,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"叶廷圭","text":"不是妙音生妙指，只缘流水似流泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22705,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"深静堂","author":"叶抑","text":"乱山苍苍溪曲盘，烟林漠漠风生寒。\n地幽景绝岂易到，中隐萧寺环峰峦。\n山僧淳朴寺亦古，筑室为堂蔽风雨。\n深静岂与众缘同，万法不传归妙处。\n堂前流水自涓涓，屋外松篁不计年。\n衲子一念俱已尽，不数岁月明晦迁。\n我来兹堂息尘虑，终日忘形得深趣。\n明朝缰锁西复东，谩写微言题所寓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22706,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绿筠轩","author":"叶抑","text":"萧萧箨龙苍且绿，直节凌云长丛玉。\n高标自是绝尘埃，便使人间无点俗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22707,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"示郭仲达 其二","author":"叶时亨","text":"男子升沉虽系天，风花高下亦俄然。\n功名未老终归手，富贵须时小著鞭。\n落魄羁怀长道路，苍茫客面染风烟。\n张仪此舌欣无恙，谈笑封侯会有年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22708,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"示郭仲达 其一","author":"叶时亨","text":"撮发从游成潦倒，拍肩话旧叹蹉跎。\n年来对酒诗狂减，老去伤时愁绪多。\n顾我曳裙今尚尔，念君求禄竟如何。\n不应例合俱穷踬，造化儿痴故作魔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22709,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泛舟松江","author":"叶时亨","text":"短棹夷由落照间，不堪凝望发愁端。\n雁行影没暮天阔，蘋叶香残秋水寒。\n朝市触涂成险棘，风波投足却轻安。\n白鸥盟在容寻理，急办烟蓑与钓竿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22710,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"口占","author":"叶李","text":"如今便一似麻糊，也是人间大丈夫。\n笔里无时那解有，命中有处未应无。\n百千万世传名节，二十三年非故居。\n寄语长安朱紫客，尽心好上帝王书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22711,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪梦","author":"叶李","text":"宋时豪士石曼卿，帝命作主芙蓉城。\n我才比石万无一，半世虚负狂直名。\n年来似有丧心疾，荐共引鲧辜苍生。\n天诛未加公论沸，日夕惟待鼎镬烹。\n何哉异梦出非想，忽遇仙老谈真情。\n谓予夙是文昌相，漏泄轻举遭弹抨。\n帝令谪堕饱忧患，且使两足蹒跚行。\n追思善步不可得，飞升妙术矧敢轻。\n当时廷议祇如此，汝悔当复惟相迎。\n稽首老仙谢慈悯，臣罪当死天子明。\n久之寂灭一大乐，斲棺待尽无他营。\n老仙笑许汝可教，引领直上朝玉京。\n通明大明二宫殿，林木蓊萃阶瑶琼。\n芙蓉烂熳锦欲似，帝皇锡以主殿名。\n赋诗奏谢九拜起，玉音嘉奖傍观荣。\n痴人说梦聊一快，我独知命不少惊。\n只恐才非曼卿敌，相见惭汗应如倾。\n从今闭目需帝召，玉楼续记时当成。\n儿孙自有儿孙福，与农报国须勤耕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22712,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金错刀 放还遇贾似道","author":"叶李","text":"君来路，吾归路，来来去去何时住。\n公田关子竟何如，国事当时谁汝误。\n雷州户，崖州户，人生会有相逢处。\n客中颇恨乏蒸羊，聊赠一篇长短句。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22713,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"翠微寺","author":"叶秀发","text":"茫茫宇宙几分离，晚识真人历数归。\n五闰都无半抔土，清风千古一麻衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22714,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"广福寺","author":"叶秀发","text":"细问黄山事，荒唐半不传。\n诸峰几林壑，十日九云烟。\n笙断空中籁，丹留涧底泉。\n相招愧猿鹤，何日谢尘缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22715,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兴国寺","author":"叶秀发","text":"虽无酒令与诗筹，喜约新盟访旧游。\n寒露正催黄菊晚，断云不锁碧山秋。\n机于空处鸥方下，节到寒时蝶也愁。\n聚散抟沙多少恨，一诗三叹寄汤休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22716,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄山喜晴即事","author":"叶秀发","text":"一春鸠妇不停鸣，远岫云归喜得晴。\n水拍秧田钗股细，风吹麦陇浪纹轻。\n天应怜我倦行役，山亦多情互送迎。\n三十六峰如好客，相逢便觉眼增明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22717,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登古城山观","author":"叶秀发","text":"飞观干霄出，疏松隔坞闻。\n水声高下涧，山色去来云。\n露舄行秋杪，天花落叶分。\n小窗吟不就，清杀病休文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22718,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题龙吟寺","author":"叶秀发","text":"晓色明征辔，疏钟忽断林。\n谭经惊虎伏，说法引龙吟。\n竹影残镫暗，苔痕落叶深。\n客怀无处适，攲枕听霜砧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22719,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉落魄 自寿","author":"叶秀发","text":"胸襟洒落。\n光风霁月澄寥廓。\n生平素志惟丘壑。\n随分田园，花木四时乐。\n儿孙不用千金橐。\n吾家自有诗书粕。\n生朝有酒团栾酌。\n因笑渠侬，痴骖画松鹤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22720,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"如归亭","author":"叶纲","text":"拍天烟浪接沧溟，识尽归舟是此亭。\n风递秋香来橘社，水资春味验茶经。\n捲帘江树差差绿，入坐湖山隐隐青。\n鲁望幽居在何处，白鸥无主满闲汀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22721,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入天章道中","author":"叶参","text":"帝俞荒址创毗耶，茂岭烟篁占一涯。\n僧入定中观水月，客来空际辩天花。\n宸章飞动凌奎彩，瀑溜清凉涨井华。\n不省永和年景趣，饫闻虚座演三车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22722,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游金庭观","author":"叶参光","text":"迢递人间入路遥，忽窥仙阙绝尘嚣。\n事寻奇异彼燕石，文载兴崇是晋朝。\n攻艺高楼无笔砚，养鹅灵沼识刍荛。\n英雄虽逐年华谢，万古真风冠碧霄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22723,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蒙亭诗和张洵韵","author":"叶宗谔","text":"我行几许踰沅湘，直抵八桂漓水旁。\n千山倒影摇溪光，秀色不借草木苍。\n兹亭构胜俯回塘，野花风递罗绮香。\n岩前伏波航羽觞，一洗尘思生清凉。\n疑有仙人白玉床，壶中景迥日月长。\n步此仙籁音琅琅，世间名利真毫芒。\n此景不独冠南方，恨不筑室轻侯王。\n回首尘迹空渺茫，瞥去未必计非良。\n其如樽酒情难忘，恍然一梦五云乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22724,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"叶宗谔","text":"凤凰台上山吞月，白鹭洲边水接天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22725,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题冯唐庙","author":"叶明","text":"千百年来汉老郎，晓来灯火晚来香。\n庭前不用寻碑记，已载班书数十行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22726,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和陈子华武夷筑精舍","author":"叶明","text":"衮衮诸公台省居，可怜无地著吾庐。\n前因本是四禅派，今日相追九老图。\n忧顾全闽曾倚重，诛锄遗孽岂容逋。\n兔葵燕麦玄都满，休忆桃霞映绿湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22727,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至道宫","author":"叶林","text":"犹存巨镬记熙丰，翠蔼春深古路通。\n千百舂锄一株树，野田飞下雪花风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22728,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登石室二首 其二","author":"叶林","text":"石径春深叠古苔，洞天无钥为谁开。\n白云本是无心物，风趁松花作雨来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22729,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登石室二首 其一","author":"叶林","text":"远游贞白二仙家，今日追寻路不赊。\n七十二丛秋色里，有人曾约去看花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22730,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石室洞","author":"叶林","text":"低垂石室洞，杖屦易跻攀。\n有路穿云窟，无门对月关。\n谁骑仙鹿去，我笑国蜗跧。\n若使今犹昨，清宵闻佩环。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22731,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈住山介石","author":"叶林","text":"造物有青眼，名山无赧容。\n声名动猿鹤，道法伏菟龙。\n望气从关尹，瞻云自华封。\n悬知仙隐地，可以不迎逢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22732,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋洞霄宫隐居十年后","author":"叶林","text":"琼馆高居势复完，烟重翠叠几峰峦。\n山从舞凤由来远，洞隔投龙欲去难。\n处处有泉那用汲，岩岩维石宛如磐。\n品题今古知多少，閒把唐僧五字看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22733,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游武夷","author":"叶枢","text":"孤台起天半，群峰罗崔巍。\n大王挺其间，玉女相因依。\n上攀牛斗墟，下窥鸥鹭矶。\n神仙遥可接，灵草正秋肥。\n念此结绸缪，岂谓赏心违。\n浮云乱幽壑，明月流清辉。\n白云凄以寒，游子各言归。\n玄鹤向我鸣，秋风吹我衣。\n愿借凌风翮，送君西北飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22734,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日呈真直院","author":"叶绍翁","text":"秋风吹客客思家，破帽从渠自在斜。\n肠断故山归未得，借人篱落种黄花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22735,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仙兴","author":"叶绍翁","text":"金书宫殿玉阑干，雪瀑泉飞洞口寒。\n日暮仙翁骑鹤去，碧桃花满石棋盘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22736,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出北关二里","author":"叶绍翁","text":"脱衣命仆洗尘埃，篱落人家未见梅。\n出得城门能几步，船头便有白鸥来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22737,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汉武帝","author":"叶绍翁","text":"殿号长秋花寂寂，台名思子草茫茫。\n尚无人世团圞乐，枉认蓬莱作帝乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22738,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"田家三咏 其二","author":"叶绍翁","text":"田因水坏秧重插，家为蚕忙户紧关。\n黄犊归来莎草阔，绿桑采尽竹梯闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22739,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"田家三咏 其三","author":"叶绍翁","text":"抱儿更送田头饭，画鬓浓调灶额烟。\n争信春风红袖女，绿杨庭院正秋千。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22740,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"田家三咏 其一","author":"叶绍翁","text":"织篱为界编红槿，排石成桥接断塍。\n野老生涯差省事，一间茅屋两池菱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22741,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖秋晚","author":"叶绍翁","text":"爱山不买城中地，畏客长撑屋后船。\n荷叶无多秋事晚，又同鸥鹭过残年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22742,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西溪","author":"叶绍翁","text":"一条横木过前溪，村女齐登采叶梯。\n独立衡门春雨细，白鸡飞上树梢啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22743,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访龙井山中村叟","author":"叶绍翁","text":"雨打荒篱豆荚垂，柴门未启立多时。\n客来自掘蹲鸱煮，旋拾枯松三数枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22744,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜书所见","author":"叶绍翁","text":"萧萧梧叶送寒声，江上秋风动客情。\n知有儿童挑促织，夜深篱落一灯明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22745,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":